 pond. A convenient 2pc powder room completes the main level. Upstairs, the primary retreat features a walk-in closet, 4pc ensuite with soaker tub & private water closet. Two additional bedrooms, a 4pc bathroom & a bonus room provide ample space for the whole family. The unfinished basement offers a separate entrance & endless potential to customize. Enjoy the landscaped backyard, raised deck & Central A/C. An ideal blend of location & lifestyle! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$599,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,927 sq ft"],["Year built","2023"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","North Ridge"],["Town","St. Albert"],["Postal code","T8N7Z7"],["MLS® number","E4512800"],["Listed","October 13, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Alarm System, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Insert, Electric"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Community","Public Swimming Pool"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.01 m × 4.32 m (13'2\" × 14'2\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.44 m × 3.70 m (8'0\" × 12'2\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","5.08 m × 4.24 m (16'8\" × 13'11\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.55 m × 5.53 m (11'8\" × 18'2\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.50 m × 4.71 m (8'2\" × 15'5\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","2.50 m × 4.19 m (8'2\" × 13'9\")"],["Bonus Room","Upper Level","3.81 m × 4.48 m (12'6\" × 14'8\")"],["Laundry room","Upper Level","2.67 m × 1.72 m (8'9\" × 5'8\")"]],"courtesy":"Erin Willman, RE/MAX Elite and Pete Muller, RE/MAX Elite","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"st-albert","hood_slug":"north-ridge","area":""}